                <pb facs="0329" n="322" sameAs="frus:frus1937v03/pg322"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">793.94/9152: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Consul General at Shanghai</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Gauss</hi>) <hi
                        rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of
                    State</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Shanghai</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1937-08-03T23:00:00+08:00">August 3, 1937—11
                        p.m.</date><lb/>[Received August 3—4:20 p.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>420. Local French newspapers state that as a measure of reprisal against the
                    French authorities at Tientsin for preventing Japanese troops from passing
                    through the French concession, the Japanese who now occupy the third special
                    area have erected barbed wire entanglements and a machine gun post at the end of
                    the International Bridge, and have refused to permit French troops to proceed to
                    the French barracks located at the East Arsenal. This paper reports also that a
                    surprise attack was made by Japanese soldiers on July 29 on a small detachment
                    of French troops who were stationed at the East Station; that the detachment was
                    disarmed and a French sergeant seriously wounded. The paper reports further that
                    the French Consul General at Tientsin has protested to the Japanese authorities
                    and has sent a detailed report to the French authorities.</p>
                <p>Repeated to Peiping, the Department and Tientsin. Mail to Nanking.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Gauss</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
